    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/instance-kinds.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The worked example, and it is the one this skill was written for",
      "prov:value": "Three beans (`jbx2`, `v1hw`, and whatever `docs/` and `folio/` get) ask for\n**visualisers**, and the bean that commissioned this skill assumed a\n`visualiser` graph typology would be needed — that it would be *\"the first kind\nwhere the answer is not obvious: it RENDERS, and what it renders is another\ngraph's content rather than its own.\"*"
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/instance-kinds.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The worked example, and it is the one this skill was written for",
      "prov:value": "Measured 2026-09-21, the question does not arise:",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-21"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/instance-kinds.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "proposal",
      "cat-harness:section": "The worked example, and it is the one this skill was written for",
      "prov:value": "It names an artefact, the way `coverage.docs` named a page until #1168 B7c.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#1168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/instance-kinds.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "The worked example, and it is the one this skill was written for",
      "prov:value": "- **The owner's own placement rule says Tool.** `v1hw`: *\"the visualiser lives\n  as a tool in the harness that DEFINES the schema, declared in\n  `skills`/`tools`.\"*"
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/instance-kinds.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Naming an instance — the prefix families",
      "prov:value": "| `who-` | WHO material | the IRIS replica (which absorbed `who-style-guide` on 2026-10-01, bean `qsx4`) |",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean qsx4",
